<v Ira Glass>[资助鸣谢]

00:58:12.120 --> 00:58:16.920
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who describes his management style this way.
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ的管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚负责，他这样描述自己的管理风格。

00:58:16.920 --> 00:58:23.840
<v Jim Harmston>Well, I'm either completely nuts or right on target, one or the other. And there isn't anything in between.
<v Jim Harmston>嗯，我要么是彻底疯了，要么就是正中目标，两者必居其一。除此之外没有任何中间地带。

00:58:23.840 --> 00:58:56.060
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周将带来更多《美国生活》的故事。

